---
import '../../styles/creative-process.css';
---

<section class="creative-process" aria-labelledby="creative-process-title">
  <div class="creative-process__intro">
    <p class="creative-process__eyebrow">Creative process</p>
    <h2 id="creative-process-title" class="creative-process__title">A practice grounded in listening, structure, and deliberate refinement.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="creative-process__list" role="list">
    <article class="creative-process__item" role="listitem">
      <p class="creative-process__number">01</p>
      <div class="creative-process__content">
        <h3 class="creative-process__heading">Understanding the context</h3>
        <p class="creative-process__text">I begin by reading the brief closely and understanding the cultural and strategic context around the work.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="creative-process__item" role="listitem">
      <p class="creative-process__number">02</p>
      <div class="creative-process__content">
        <h3 class="creative-process__heading">Defining the direction</h3>
        <p class="creative-process__text">From there, I shape a clear point of view that can guide the visual language and the experience.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="creative-process__item" role="listitem">
      <p class="creative-process__number">03</p>
      <div class="creative-process__content">
        <h3 class="creative-process__heading">Building the systems</h3>
        <p class="creative-process__text">I focus on structure: typography, hierarchy, interaction, and motion. The system has to hold under pressure.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="creative-process__item" role="listitem">
      <p class="creative-process__number">04</p>
      <div class="creative-process__content">
        <h3 class="creative-process__heading">Refining the details</h3>
        <p class="creative-process__text">The final stage is restraint and precision. Each decision is brought into focus until it feels inevitable.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
